# [[.Name]] Backend

FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, and Alembic backend for [[.DisplayName]].

```bash
uv sync --extra dev
cp .env.example .env
uv run uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

Run tests with `uv run pytest`. Create and apply migrations with
`uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "change"` and
`uv run alembic upgrade head`.
